  "name": "va_swarm_pad",
  "description": "Swarm pad: osc 1 = a unison of 7 saws, osc 2 = 7 more one octave down (14 saws per note), spread wide across the stereo field. Each saw has its own desynchronized motion LFO, and the per-voice detune LFOs 2-4 plus the LFO-of-LFO move the whole swarm. Slow swell, soft low-pass, meant for a big reverb.",
